    <title>《Digital Fairness Act》对游戏行业意味着什么</title>
    <link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/what-the-digital-fairness-act-means-for-the-games-industry</link>
    <description>欧盟委员会正式提出Digital Fairness Act草案，若通过将对游戏行业尤其是虚拟货币相关业务产生重大影响。对休闲手游的虚拟币设计、付费合规和欧洲市场运营有直接参考价值。</description>
    <category>行业资讯</category>
    <author>GamesIndustry.biz</author>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:29:10 +0800</pubDate>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.gamesindustry.biz/what-the-digital-fairness-act-means-for-the-games-industry</guid>
  </item>
